  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340207b51513cdf8",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 3.5 让 OCR 和文档解析任务与 Hugging Face 生态系统的联系更加紧密。在此版本中，受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型可以通过以下设置，使用 Hugging Face Transformers 作为推理后端运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f1412c73356726f",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 继续提供 PP-OCRv5 等 OCR 模型系列，以及 PaddleOCR-VL 1.5 等文档解析模型系列，同时 Transformers 成为运行这些模型的受支持后端之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ecd90692809b63c",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face Spaces 上试用在线演示：https://huggingface.co/spaces/PaddlePaddle/paddleocr-3.5-transformers-demo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "07f74744c686c1fa",
      "translationZh": "有哪些变化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8d3e97a3ac0eef3",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 3.5 引入了更加灵活的推理引擎接口。开发者可以通过 engine 参数选择后端，并通过 engine_config 传递特定于该后端的选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2152392dc16d005c",
      "translationZh": "在实际使用中，这意味着：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b0b14b1a33d1821",
      "translationZh": "这些任务背后的流水线由 PaddleOCR 管理，因此开发者无需手动调用每个内部组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c6ecd6c6a4089c8",
      "translationZh": "Transformers 成为运行受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型的推理后端之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75240b32c26e03c1",
      "translationZh": "开发者可以通过 engine_config 配置与后端相关的选项，例如 dtype、设备放置和注意力实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5553afe76750e27",
      "translationZh": "可以用一种简单的方式来理解这个技术栈：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac9ffcb2bf47f999",
      "translationZh": "层级",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eed88f3aa1edf2d6",
      "translationZh": "含义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e68ee04dff59551b",
      "translationZh": "示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0042554f94ecbcf",
      "translationZh": "应用层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4467a254b0483c75",
      "translationZh": "使用 OCR 和文档解析输出的应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "866cbf48694f874e",
      "translationZh": "RAG、智能体、Document AI……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fd092bed03aee0b",
      "translationZh": "模型层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab44a55a3a0bc01f",
      "translationZh": "OCR 和文档解析能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf327f2299f8ee03",
      "translationZh": "推理后端层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5c0d7f1507c08a5",
      "translationZh": "用于运行受支持模型的运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75cdf64d2363461f",
      "translationZh": "Paddle 静态图、Paddle 动态图、Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c420db5c1c8474fd",
      "translationZh": "此次发布主要围绕推理后端层：PaddleOCR 继续提供 OCR 和文档解析能力，而 Transformers 则为受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型提供了另一种后端选择，能够自然融入以 Hugging Face 为中心的环境。更广泛的文档 AI 工作流仍由开发者和应用构建者掌控。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8893dff34c02db6a",
      "translationZh": "这为何重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db4e6cff467d5c33",
      "translationZh": "对于 RAG、文档 AI 和文档智能体应用而言，难点往往在 LLM 介入之前就已经出现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fcbcc970764f01c",
      "translationZh": "开发者首先需要将 PDF、扫描文档、屏幕截图、表格、图表、公式以及复杂的页面布局转化为可靠的结构化数据。如果这一数据摄取环节薄弱，下游 LLM 工作流就可能遗漏关键信息、检索到错误的上下文，或生成不可靠的答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07811a3f2bf2b2d9",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 通过提供 PP-OCRv5 等 OCR 系列模型以及 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 等文档解析系列模型，帮助应对这一文档摄取难题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe29102a5cbd93aa",
      "translationZh": "借助 PaddleOCR 3.5，这些能力现在更容易接入以 Transformers 为中心的技术栈。受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型可以使用 Transformers 后端运行，而 PaddleOCR 仍会在幕后管理 OCR 或文档解析流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae229b553ddf4336",
      "translationZh": "对开发者而言，这意味着更少的集成阻力，以及一条从文档通往下游 RAG、智能体、搜索、分析或自动化工作流的更自然的路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0eb95fb6244c03f1",
      "translationZh": "快速入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bea75366bec1657",
      "translationZh": "安装 PaddleOCR 3.5、PaddleX、Transformers，以及与你的硬件兼容的 PyTorch 构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "366c5dd4aaf95d9f",
      "translationZh": "例如，在 CUDA 12.6 环境中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaddffc80e8b5e6f",
      "translationZh": "对于 CPU、ROCm 或其他环境，请安装与你的目标硬件相匹配的 PyTorch 构建版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51003f0f16c9fcd2",
      "translationZh": "从命令行运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4257f597169568ce",
      "translationZh": "或者使用 Python API：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99be6718af78363a",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Space 使用 float32 以实现广泛的兼容性。对于你自己的硬件，可以通过 engine_config 调整特定于后端的选项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0717a143b3869ea9",
      "translationZh": "最佳配置取决于你的模型、硬件和部署环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "83c429547b140ac3",
      "translationZh": "什么时候应该使用 Transformers 后端？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25755547bb628a06",
      "translationZh": "当你希望将 PaddleOCR 的 OCR 和文档解析能力更自然地融入以 Hugging Face 为中心的技术栈时，可以使用 Transformers 后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1473b55d22f344f4",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在构建 RAG、文档 AI、搜索、分析或智能体应用，并且已经依赖 PyTorch / Transformers 基础设施来进行模型加载、实验、部署或模型制品管理，那么这尤其有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edf547dc4b6bbbf5",
      "translationZh": "当你有以下需求时，Transformers 后端是一个不错的选择：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f31a859330dd16c9",
      "translationZh": "为已经使用 Transformers 的团队提供更熟悉的开发体验，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5b2b008a314fdbf",
      "translationZh": "为受支持的 PaddleOCR 模型提供与 Hub 兼容的模型发现和分发功能，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32f173c4a8c4c4b9",
      "translationZh": "更轻松地与现有的 PyTorch / Transformers 服务集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9393efb2aab45913",
      "translationZh": "当首要目标是最大限度地提高 OCR 或文档解析的吞吐量时，通常建议选择 PaddleOCR 默认的 paddle_static 后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca55a4341fef2975",
      "translationZh": "此次发布并不是要用一个后端取代另一个后端，而是要为开发者提供更大的灵活性：使用 PaddleOCR 提供的 OCR 和文档解析能力，并选择最适合自身技术栈的推理后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "addb776b173a84f2",
      "translationZh": "立即试用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7c9f4ecc54f33cf",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face Spaces 上试用 PaddleOCR 3.5 Transformers 演示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3be5829534333dcf",
      "translationZh": "在 Hub 上探索 PaddleOCR 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1399aba3de16b7c",
      "translationZh": "PaddleOCR 3.5 让 OCR 和文档解析能力更贴近以 Transformers 为中心的工作流，同时让开发者能够自由地围绕这些能力构建更大规模的文档 AI 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
