    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdfffb369478325b",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 上的 PaddlePaddle 组织：https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb9f6e6d0df56d03",
      "translationZh": "Spaces 上的 PaddleOCR 3.5 Transformers 演示：https://huggingface.co/spaces/PaddlePaddle/paddleocr-3.5-transformers-demo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea89489496ef6c3",
      "translationZh": "我们衷心感谢为 PaddleOCR 3.5 与 Transformers 的集成提供支持的 Hugging Face 工程师。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4476d84710d24044",
      "translationZh": "特别感谢 Anton Vlasjuk 的全程参与，包括审查和合并所有相关的拉取请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b71819ec425d9dbf",
      "translationZh": "我们也感谢 Raushan Turganbay 和 Yoni Gozlan 提供的宝贵 PR 审查意见和反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
